---
import InfoLayout from "../layouts/InfoLayout.astro";
---
<InfoLayout>
    <div class="p-4 sm:pt-8 sm:px-12 pb-20 min-h-dvh flex flex-col justify-between gap-32">
        <div class="space-y-4 sm:space-y-12">
            <h1 class="text-white font-bold text-balance text-4xl md:text-6xl xl:text-8xl tracking-tight">About Me</h1>
            <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-500 text-balance">
                Welcome! I am rising senior computer science and mathematics 
                student at Stevens Institute of Technology.
            </p>
            <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-500 text-balance">
                I have been programming for about 10 years and recently my current 
                interests include high-performance computing/parallelism, computer 
                architectures, and GPU computing. I am interested in high-performance, 
                low-latency programming in C++ and want to pursue it as a career within 
                the software engineering space.
            </p>
            <p class="text-xl xl:text-2xl text-zinc-500 text-balance">
                My most recent professional experiences include being a Software
                Engineer intern at Tier-1 asset manager PanAgora Asset Management and
                as Quantitative Developer Intern (C#/C++) at Quantifi, working on low-latency pricing
                solutions on financial derivatives and tools as well as Quantifi C# core.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2 text-lg">
            <h2 class="px-4 text-zinc-400 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-500">Achievements/Recent News</h2>

            <ul class="px-4 text-zinc-400 list-disc list-outside">
                <li>08/20/2025: My new website goes live</li>
                <li>05/29/2025: Joined Quantifi as a Quantitative Developer Intern</li>
                <li>01/29/2025: Accepted into Stevens Student Managed Investment Fund as a Quant</li>
                <li>05/27/2024: Joined PanAgora Asset Management as a Software Engineer Intern</li>
                <li>09/15/2023: Illuminatio Development Group is created</li>
                <li>08/14/2023: My undergraduate research at SIAI has ended</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</InfoLayout>